From: kexec diagnostics <local@invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: carry bounded sampled GPU ranges through file-load FDT

Diagnostic only. An explicit target selector accepts a versioned initrd trailer,
copies its metadata before IMA placement, strips only the validated suffix and
carries the blob into /chosen. Separate per-image ranges participate in the
existing GIC-aware placement search and survive until kimage destruction.
No GPU/SCM operation, DMA backing access, ownership or quiescence claim.
Default disabled behavior does not inspect or strip the supplied initrd.

